Z||000005||rockcrawl||04-26-2001||04:44 PM||||Cosmo,<BR> Yours does not look like a Corson top, it doesn't match the pictures I have. The Corson conversion used a lever type latch on each side like T-top latches. The Corson top has a support rib in the center. Front-to-back it is not as wide as yours. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targa.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targa.jpg</A> <p>[This message has been edited by rockcrawl (edited 04-26-2001).]||||reg||1
