Z||000009||Cozmo||04-27-2001||08:36 AM||||You're right, Rockcrawl!!!<BR>After examining that pic you pointed out I see they are similar but definitely not the same manufacturer.  They also state in the ad that their top fits in the Fiero trunk, there is NO WAY that mine fits in there... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>The only markings on my top is a sticker where the dome lights would go that says "Targa Top" (duh!)  I'd really like to find out the history on this conversion, it is a real professional job definitely not a one-off thing...If anyone knows  anything about this, pleez LMK!!!<BR>(PS the engine is just about reassembled, hope to FIRE IT UP this weekend) not literally, I hope <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>C02M0||||reg||14
